&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;クランチロールは、米国のソニー・ピクチャーズ エンタテインメントと、日本の株式会社ソニー・ミュージックエンタテインメントの子会社であるアニプレックス（両社とも東京に本社を置くソニーグループ株式会社傘下）の合弁会社です。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;職務内容について&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;シニア・プロデューサーとして、アニメ共同製作チームのバイスプレジデントにに報告します。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;東京オフィス勤務の応募者を募集しています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;この職務の主な目標は、世界がまだ知らないさまざまなジャンルを紹介し、世界中の新たなアニメファンを惹きつけることができるエキサイティングなストーリーと美しいアニメーションを制作パートナーと共に共同開発・制作することです。それぞれの市場のトレンドに細心の注意を払い、世界各国のファンの注目を集め、プラットフォームの新規加入者獲得に貢献、さらなる利益を生み出すことのできるコンテンツを選定します。制作チームAの責任者をサポートし、戦略構築やチーム・マネジメントを行っていただきます。コンテンツの企画製作や二次利用の知見また業界での幅広いネットワークを活かして、担当作品の制作だけでなく、他チームメンバーの企画制作にも取り組んでいただきます。マネージャーとして、チームの若手プロデューサーやアソシエイト・プロデューサーを指導し、メンターとして建設的なフィードバックを提供することが求められます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;主な担当業務&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;クランチロールの配信サービス地域に適した作品や企画を提案&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;共同製作委員会によるアニメコンテンツの企画製作&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;製作パートナーとの円滑な関係構築&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;製作委員会とクランチロール社内チームとの円滑なコミュニケーションを促進&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;チームAのプロデューサー、アソシエイト・プロデューサーの指導、育成&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;応募資格:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12年以上のアニメ業界での実務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3年以上のチームマネジメント経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;著作権ビジネス全般の専門知識&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;アニメ制作・マーケティング経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;日本のアニメトレンドの理解、海外のアニメトレンドへの関心&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ネイティブまたはビジネスレベルの日本語力、会話レベルもしくはそれ以上の英語力と今後の学習意欲&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;グローバル企業での勤務経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;グローバルな視点からの分析経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;部署に関して&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;クランチロールはコンテンツの取得で広く認知されている一方、日本のアニメ業界においても重要な流通・投資パートナーとしての地位を確立しています。プロダクションチームはコンテンツチームの一部門であり、アニメ作品の製作において外部パートナーとの協業に注力しています。同チームの戦略的焦点は、クランチロールのタイトルラインナップを強化し、サービス提供地域全体におけるアニメ市場の成長に貢献することにあります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;クランチロールで働く魅力とは&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;楽しく、情熱的で、インスピレーション豊かな同僚と働けるだけでなく、以下のような福利厚生も享受できます：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ソニー健康保険組合による健康保険&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;確定拠出年金&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;各種定額手当（ジム＆ウェルネス代、携帯電話代、食事代）通勤手当&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;クランチロール・プレミアムアカウント&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;職能や専門能力の開発プログラム&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;有給育児休暇&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;出産する社員には最長22週間まで&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;パートナーが出産する社員には12週間まで&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ハイブリッド勤務&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;フレックスタイム&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;有給休暇および休業&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;フレキシブルタイムオフ&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;年5日間のYasumi Day休業日&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;夏季の金曜半日勤務&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;お盆休み3日間&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ql-indent-1&quot;&gt;年末年始休業&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LifeAtCrunchyroll #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About our Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be everything for someone rather than something for everyone and we do this by living and modeling our values in all that we do. We value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Courage. We believe that when we overcome fear, we enable our best selves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity. We are curious, which is the gateway to empathy, inclusion, and understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaizen. We have a growth mindset committed to constant forward progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service. We serve our community with humility, enabling joy and belonging for others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission of helping people belong reflects our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion. It&#39;s just the way we do business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at Crunchyroll. Pursuant to applicable law, we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll, LLC is an independently operated joint venture between US-based Sony Pictures Entertainment, and Japan&#39;s Aniplex, a subsidiary of Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc., both subsidiaries of Tokyo-based Sony Group Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Questions about Crunchyroll’s hiring process? Please check out our Hiring FAQs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&quot;&gt;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;Candidate Privacy Policy for more information about how we process your personal information, and your data protection rights: &lt;a href=&quot;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&quot;&gt;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please beware of recent scams to online job seekers. Those applying to our job openings will only be contacted directly from @crunchyroll.com email account.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;In the role of &lt;em&gt;Accounting Director&lt;/em&gt;, you will report to the Senior Director, Rest of World (ROW) Accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are considering applicants for the location of Mexico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Accounting Director is responsible for overseeing the accounting operations of our entity located in Mexico, ensuring the integrity of financial reporting, compliance with regulatory requirements (Local GAAP and IFRS ), and global policies. This role is a key business partner of the global team ( Consolidation, GBS (AP), Tax, Procurement, T&amp;amp;E, HR teams), local third party advisors. This is a new role in charge of a new entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Areas of Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Reporting &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and review monthly, quarterly, and annual financial statements, trending analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with Local GAAP/IFRS and local tax, regulatory requirements, SOX controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage general ledger accuracy and reconciliation processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee local tax filings, audits, and statutory reporting and liaise with global accounting teams (consolidation, tax).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong internal controls to safeguard company assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accounting Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and post journal entries in Netsuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepares treasury activities (account reconciliation, posting, approval, excess of&amp;nbsp; cash, request of fundings).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calculates transfer pricing and processes invoicing, intercompany reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure timely month-end and year-end closing processes regarding mainly accounts payables, accounts receivable, payroll, royalties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor cash flow and financial transactions, approve payments and ensure payments in a timely manner of Payroll, taxes, licensors, third parties..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage Fixed Asset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit &amp;amp; Risk Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internal and external audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain accounting policies and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify financial risks and recommend mitigation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with internal controls and financial policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve accounts payables, receivable, payroll once escalated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve escalated challenges raised by internal* or external customers, third parties. (*internal customer such as HR working with Cloudpay on payslips)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow any IT, Netsuite tickets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary conduit for Mexico accounting activities, tracking deliverables, escalating issues as needed, and ensuring successful execution across supporting teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of accountability and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the local General Manager, Administrative Management team, and regional subject matter experts to support operational, compliance, and business-related requests impacting the Mexico entity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Analysis &amp;amp; Strategic Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide financial analysis to support business decisions, global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist any business partner with budgeting and forecasting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with senior management on financial planning initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cost control and efficiency improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We get excited about candidates, like you, because you have…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or related field (required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CPA, ACCA, CMA, or equivalent certification preferred&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive accounting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financial reporting and audits in Mexican GAAP and IFRS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Used to work for a Mexican affiliate company, member of an international group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and Spanish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of accounting principles and financial regulations in Mexico&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in accounting software and ERP systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and communication abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of integrity and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Conditions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid – based in Mexico City (at the office aligned with the policy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May require extended hours during closing periods or audits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you will love working at Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to getting to work with fun, passionate and inspired colleagues, you will also enjoy above-law benefits and perks:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LifeAtCrunchyroll ((select from the following job modalities for this role: #LI-Hybrid #LI-remote #LI-onsite))&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About our Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be everything for someone rather than something for everyone and we do this by living and modeling our values in all that we do. We value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Courage. We believe that when we overcome fear, we enable our best selves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity. We are curious, which is the gateway to empathy, inclusion, and understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaizen. We have a growth mindset committed to constant forward progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service. We serve our community with humility, enabling joy and belonging for others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission of helping people belong reflects our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion. It&#39;s just the way we do business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at Crunchyroll. Pursuant to applicable law, we do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll, LLC is an independently operated joint venture between US-based Sony Pictures Entertainment, and Japan&#39;s Aniplex, a subsidiary of Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc., both subsidiaries of Tokyo-based Sony Group Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Questions about Crunchyroll’s hiring process? Please check out our Hiring FAQs:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&quot;&gt;https://help.crunchyroll.com/hc/en-us/articles/360040471712-Crunchyroll-Hiring-FAQs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;Candidate Privacy Policy for more information about how we process your personal information, and your data protection rights: &lt;a href=&quot;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&quot;&gt;https://tbcdn.talentbrew.com/company/22978/v1_0/docs/spe-jobs-privacy-policy-update-for-crpa-dec-21-22.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please beware of recent scams to online job seekers. Those applying to our job openings will only be contacted directly from @crunchyroll.com email account.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll, LLC is an independently operated joint venture between US-based Sony Pictures Entertainment, and Japan&#39;s Aniplex, a subsidiary of Sony Music Entertainment (Japan) Inc., both subsidiaries of Tokyo-based Sony Group Corporation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Accounts Payable team is looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Accounts Payable Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to support accurate and timely payment processing across our international business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will process vendor and contractual payments, help resolve payment issues, support financial controls, and partner with cross-functional teams including Accounting, Finance, Tax, Procurement, Legal, Business Affairs, and Treasury.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Accounts Payable Analyst will also support AP reporting, reconciliations, issue resolution, and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Day in the Life of Our Accounts Payable Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and process invoices and payment requests after confirming proper authorization, coding, documentation, and approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process contractual and vendor payment obligations by reviewing applicable terms, validating required support, confirming payment timing, and ensuring accurate and timely processing in accordance with company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and support international Accounts Payable transactions across multiple entities and currencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review vendor aging and assist with resolving past-due, outstanding, or disputed invoices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform vendor statement reconciliations and research payment or invoice discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal stakeholders to resolve missing documentation, approvals, tax information, or other payment-related issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure appropriate documentation and payment support is maintained in accordance with company policies, SOX controls, and audit requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Tax team to support tax compliance for domestic and international payments, including withholding tax requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support intercompany transactions and help ensure proper documentation and coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and support AP reporting related to vendor aging, liabilities, upcoming payments, and open issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify payment discrepancies, duplicate-payment risks, or process issues and escalate as appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong relationships with vendors and internal stakeholders by providing timely and professional support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with AP team members, share knowledge, and support onboarding and team initiatives as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in opportunities to improve Accounts Payable processes, controls, reporting, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support ERP, procure-to-pay, and Finance transformation initiatives as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal and external audit requests and other ad hoc projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, Business Administration, or a related field, or equivalent relevant professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of Accounts Payable, accounting, or related Finance experience, preferably within a large or multinational organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both English and Spanish, with strong written and verbal communication skills in both languages, is required.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the Accounts Payable lifecycle, including invoice processing, approvals, payments, reconciliations, aging, and issue resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience processing vendor and contractual payment obligations, including reviewing payment terms, documentation requirements, and due dates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting transactions involving multiple entities, currencies, or jurisdictions preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of intercompany transactions, financial controls, SOX requirements, and audit support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ERP systems and automated AP or procure-to-pay platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;NetSuite and Coupa&lt;/strong&gt; preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills and proficiency with Microsoft Office and/or Google Workspace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, organizational, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and meet deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
