&lt;p&gt;We get excited about candidates, like you, because...&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience with licensing and business affairs experience in an international setup, preferably in the animation, entertainment, consumer products, content licensing, or video game industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience drafting deal terms and interpreting licensing agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating rights and analyzing risk regarding business affairs contracts and licenses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing licensing content and IPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with project management and related project management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for Anime, Japanese culture, and the Entertainment industry, with an understanding of Japanese business culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
