&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll is seeking a skilled Deal Management Analyst with experience in contractual data capture, particularly in Film/TV rights and royalties. The candidate will be responsible for setting up and maintaining rights and&amp;nbsp; financial statements in Crunchyroll systems, tracking new deals, researching contractual terms, conducting analyses on data extracts, and developing process improvements and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the set up and help maintain deal terms in Crunchyroll systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
