&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;64&quot; data-end=&quot;257&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Internal Communications Senior Manager to serve as the strategic communications partner to our People Experience organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;259&quot; data-end=&quot;679&quot;&gt;Reporting to the VP of Internal Communications, you&#39;ll help employees understand and engage with the programs, policies, benefits, learning opportunities, and organizational updates that shape the employee experience. Through thoughtful storytelling, strategic communications, and impactful campaigns, you&#39;ll connect employees to Crunchyroll&#39;s mission, vision, culture, and values while ensuring they have the information and context they need to thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;681&quot; data-end=&quot;1056&quot;&gt;As a trusted partner to People Experience leaders and stakeholders, you&#39;ll provide communications counsel, develop compelling content and campaigns, and help drive employee engagement across key initiatives. You&#39;ll leverage data and insights to continuously improve communications effectiveness and ensure content is relevant, timely, and impactful across a global workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead communications strategies, content, and campaigns supporting People Experience programs, including benefits, policies, organizational change, learning and development, employee engagement, workplace initiatives, and employee resource groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;852&quot; data-end=&quot;990&quot;&gt;Partner with People Experience leaders, executives, and stakeholders to develop communications plans, messaging, and engagement strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;992&quot; data-end=&quot;1130&quot;&gt;Provide communications counsel on messaging, timing, and change management communications, including sensitive or business-critical topics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1132&quot; data-end=&quot;1277&quot;&gt;Develop executive communications in support of People Experience initiatives, including leadership messages, presentations, campaigns, and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1279&quot; data-end=&quot;1437&quot;&gt;Create and manage multi-channel content that informs, educates, and engages employees while reinforcing Crunchyroll&#39;s culture, values, and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1439&quot; data-end=&quot;1562&quot;&gt;Identify and develop storytelling opportunities that connect employees to Crunchyroll, each other, and the broader business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1564&quot; data-end=&quot;1682&quot;&gt;Manage employee engagement campaigns, experiences, and activations that drive awareness, participation, and connection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1684&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Measure communications performance and employee engagement metrics to drive continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
