&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll is seeking an execution-focused&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, (GTM)&lt;/strong&gt; to support the UCANZ region (United States, Canada, Australia, and New Zealand). This individual will play a critical role in driving the planning, execution, and operational excellence of regional GTM initiatives, partnering closely with cross-functional teams to deliver subscriber growth and business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help drive GTM execution for Crunchyroll&#39;s owned-and-operated platform and key distribution partners, including Amazon, Apple, Google, YouTube, Roku, Comcast, PlayStation, Samsung, and others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Go-To-Market Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the day-to-day execution and coordination of GTM initiatives across the UCANZ region, ensuring workstreams are aligned with strategic priorities and have clear owners, timelines, dependencies, and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional stakeholders to coordinate campaigns, partner initiatives, and regional priorities across Marketing, Content, Lifecycle, Analytics, Operations, Product and Business Development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear project plans, trackers, timelines, dependencies, risks, and mitigation strategies for multiple concurrent initiatives so stakeholders have current visibility into progress, dependencies, decisions, and areas requiring attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accountability across stakeholders, proactively removing blockers and ensuring successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Analysis &amp;amp; Business Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track regional business performance against subscriber, engagement, revenue, and campaign targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze performance versus plan, identify trends, risks, and opportunities, and provide actionable recommendations to improve business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics, Finance, Lifecycle, and User Acquisition teams to develop reporting frameworks and performance dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key GTM KPIs and prepare regular executive-ready reporting on regional performance, market trends, and operational health, and key risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data to inform prioritization, resource allocation, and future GTM strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key operational partner to the GTM UCANZ leadership team, ensuring initiatives move forward efficiently and consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process gaps and proactively recommend workflow improvements that increase speed, visibility, and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep trackers, dashboards, business reviews, and project documentation accurate and up to date, helping establish clear sources of truth for the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive-ready presentations, dashboards, trackers, business reviews, and project documentation with exceptional attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize complex information into concise insights, recommendations, and next steps for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships across Product, Content, Marketing, Lifecycle, Analytics, Finance, Business Development, Regional teams, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate initiatives across global and regional stakeholders, ensuring alignment on priorities, milestones, and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a highly matrixed organization, influencing without direct authority and effectively navigating changing priorities and ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are considering US-Remote applicants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in strategy, consulting, business operations, program management, go-to-market, or project management within entertainment, media, technology, gaming, or a fast-paced consumer business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success managing complex cross-functional projects from concept through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience interpreting business performance, measuring results against targets, and developing data-driven recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building executive dashboards, reports, business reviews, and presentations using data to tell compelling business stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with project management, including planning, prioritization, dependency management, and stakeholder coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Excel/Google Sheets and PowerPoint/Google Slides skills; experience with BI and reporting tools (e.g., Tableau, Looker, Power BI).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crunchyroll&#39;s continued global expansion is driven by strong regional execution and integrated growth strategies. The GTM &amp;amp; Planning team partners closely with U.S.-based leadership and regional teams to develop and execute go-to-market strategies that grow Crunchyroll&#39;s subscriber base, deepen fan engagement, and maximize the impact of its owned-and-operated platform and strategic distribution partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the broader Growth &amp;amp; Planning organization, the team sits at the center of regional strategy, operational planning, and cross-functional execution, bringing together Product, Marketing, Content, Analytics, Lifecycle, Business Development, and Operations to deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Pay Range for this position is listed. Actual pay will vary based on factors including, but not limited to location, experience, and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$72&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$80 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About our Values&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to be everything for someone rather than something for everyone and we do this by living and modeling our values in all that we do. We value&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Courage. We believe that when we overcome fear, we enable our best selves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity. We are curious, which is the gateway to empathy, inclusion, and understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kaizen. We have a growth mindset committed to constant forward progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service. We serve our community with humility, enabling joy and belonging for others.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission of helping people belong reflects our commitment to diversity &amp;amp; inclusion. It&#39;s just the way we do business.&lt;/p&gt;
