&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a detail-oriented and highly organized Metadata Manager to help ensure the accuracy, consistency, and scalability of our content and data systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will collaborate with a wide range of internal and external stakeholders across multiple lines of business, serving as a key partner in maintaining high-quality descriptive metadata and supporting efficient content operations. You will play a critical role in enabling content discovery and delivery, improving data integrity, and driving alignment across teams and workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an exciting opportunity for someone with a deep passion for anime and strong metadata expertise to make a direct impact on content launches and the fan experience. Your knowledge will help ensure our content is accurately represented, easily discoverable, and ready for audiences around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate meaningful, actionable insights from large data and metadata sources to stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain standards for data quality, taxonomy, and metadata management to ensure data is reliable, consistent, and accessible&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter and manage descriptive metadata across all localized languages within CMS tools&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate hierarchical structures registered by the data governance team to ensure accuracy and alignment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze data received from licensors and cross-functional teams to ensure compliance with delivery requirements and standards&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform ongoing data quality checks, audits, and issue resolution to maintain data integrity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong cross-functional partnerships and drive consensus on data standards, workflows, and best practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain SOP documentation to support evolving standards, processes, and guidelines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to building and refining hierarchies that power the digital supply chain and content discoverability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage go-to-market (GTM) rollouts, including verifying dataset completion, tracking readiness, and managing timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Metadata management, data operations, or a related role within the anime, media or entertainment industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience managing projects using various organizational tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in Google Workspace, Microsoft Office, and collaboration tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Airtable proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-lingual speakers are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
