&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Social Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Mexico City&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Paid Social Senior Manager to manage performance marketing strategy and execution. This role will be responsible for scaling multi-market user acquisition through paid social channels, balancing global strategy with local market nuance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings deep hands-on expertise in paid social, strong cross-cultural collaboration skills, and experience partnering with US-based leadership and global teams. This role requires both analytical rigor and creative sensitivity to local audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Social Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and scale paid social performance to meet specific business KPIs and expectations across global markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute full-funnel strategies across Meta, TikTok, Snapchat, and emerging social platforms, with an emphasis on lower-funnel/performance media campaigns.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive performance through audience segmentation, creative testing, and optimization frameworks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with analytics to ensure strong measurement, incrementality, and attribution alignment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate global growth strategy into locally relevant execution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Global Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with US-based leadership and global growth teams to align priorities and reporting.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional marketing, creative, product, and analytics teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and performance updates to senior stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong communication across time zones and organizational structures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage agency partners where applicable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver thought leadership on the paid social and performance marketing landscape.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively pitch, build, and deploy innovative testing to drive incremental acquisition growth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in paid social or performance marketing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of scaling acquisitions in international markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on expertise in Meta Ads Manager, TikTok, Snapchat, and other major social platforms.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with US-based leadership and/or global teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with experience using data to drive optimization.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of bespoke creative strategy per platform and cultural nuances.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in subscription businesses, entertainment, anime, or fandom-driven brands is a strong plus.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable, efficient growth across social platforms.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear alignment between global strategy and regional execution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative performance driven by local insights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
