&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Salesforce Technical Administrator of the CXT Team, you will help strengthen and scale our Salesforce Service Cloud foundation within the broader CX technology stack. You will bring deep Salesforce Service Cloud expertise to enhance platform stability, governance, and release discipline while collaborating closely with teammates across Customer Experience (CX), Product, integrations, self-service, QA, WFM, and data systems. You will understand how Salesforce Service Cloud supports real-world customer support organizations and is comfortable operating at the intersection of administration, automation, and light development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the role of Salesforce Technical Administrator, you will report to the Senior Manager, CX Technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are considering applicants for the location of Dallas, TX.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Areas of Responsibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Service Cloud Systems &amp;amp; Configuration&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen and support our Service Cloud configuration, including roles, profiles, permission sets, and record-level security (OWD, sharing rules, role hierarchy).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and maintain case management features, including assignment rules, queues, escalation rules, and auto-response rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Omni-Channel routing configuration and capacity management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain record types, page layouts, dynamic forms, and Lightning app configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with CX stakeholders and teammates to translate operational needs into scalable Salesforce solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
