&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain Flows (record-triggered, screen flows, scheduled flows).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain validation rules and approval processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot automation and system errors in collaboration with the broader CXT team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, test, and occasionally modify simple Apex classes or triggers as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering for more complex custom development work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Platform Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain Crunchyroll&#39;s external, customer-facing Experience Cloud help center, including site configuration, user access, knowledge visibility, SEO configuration, Mixpanel reporting, and customer authentication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment between the Experience site, Service Cloud case management, and Sierra AI chat to support seamless self-service, case deflection, and escalation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with QA and WFM stakeholders to ensure case data, dispositions, and performance metrics flow accurately for quality scoring and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
