&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is looking for someone with the passion and skills to support the evolution of our corporate security team. A specific focus will be on defining processes and implementing technology to support a comprehensive enterprise security program, including governance, risk, and compliance. This role will be responsible for ensuring we are designing and evolving technologies in consideration of employee needs, supporting long-range strategy, cross-functional projects, and initiatives across Crunchyroll globally. This role will require a strong partnership across Crunchyroll’s teams, including Legal, Engineering, IT, People, Workplace Experience, Trust &amp;amp; Safety, as well as third party contractors, and suppliers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have 80% of the requirements below, apply now!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 2+ years of experience in Information Security or Information Technology or a BS in Computer Science or related degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience as an administrator for security and/or IT management platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong fundamental understanding of security best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a basic understanding of cybersecurity concepts such as:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Email and phishing prevention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Endpoint protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity and access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incident response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network monitoring and controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vulnerability management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have familiarity with operating systems such as MacOS, Linux, and Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have basic knowledge of networking concepts such as TCP/IP, DNS, HTTPS, firewalls, and VPNs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to troubleshoot complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to communicate complex issues to a wide audience, from technical staff to management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a positive and collaborative attitude toward work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a curious mindset and a desire to grow in a dynamic, security-focused environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pluses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have security certification(s) such as Security+ or ISC2 Certified in Cybersecurity&lt;/li&gt;
