&lt;li&gt;You have strong production experience with Python and/or TypeScript across backend, frontend, data, API, or cloud-native systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience using AI coding agents or tools such as Claude Code, Google Antigravity, Codex, Cursor, or similar systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong engineering judgment for reviewing AI-generated code and knowing where human oversight is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building or integrating services, APIs, relational data stores, event-driven systems, and user-facing workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re familiar with cloud-native development, preferably GCP, including CI/CD, monitoring, security scanning, and cost-aware engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
