&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting customer experience, customer support, contact center, or operations functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of statistical analysis, experimentation, forecasting, and predictive modeling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to balance strategic thinking with hands-on analytical execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA or advanced degree in Analytics, Statistics, Economics, Mathematics, Data Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
