&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible role that sits at the intersection of Customer Experience, Analytics, Product, Content, Marketing, Subscription, and Customer Support. You will be responsible for developing a comprehensive understanding of the LATAM customer journey, identifying opportunities to improve satisfaction and loyalty, and championing the voice of the customer throughout the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong analytical expertise, customer obsession, business acumen, and a deep understanding of the LATAM market. They are equally comfortable diving into data, presenting executive-level insights, and leading high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
