&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced, detail-oriented Senior Program Manager with a passion for leading teams, coordinating information, and solving problems across the IT organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be based on-site at least 3 days per week in our Dallas office and will play a critical role in managing Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC) initiatives. Candidates must be able to work onsite at our Dallas, TX location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings a strong program management background, has demonstrated the ability to deliver against company strategic goals, and drives value through efficient process and data-driven insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position will report into the Senior Director of Program Management for the Technology Solutions group and will work closely with various teams across the business to support pivotal initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Areas of Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organize, plan and track ongoing projects and strategic initiatives for the Technology Solutions teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the day-to-day progress of projects and initiatives with regard to schedule, scope, and process - and organizes information so it’s digestible for a globally distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively lead meetings, track next actions, and proactively follow up on action items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and leverage effective partnerships across technical and business communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a key liaison with relevant business groups to facilitate planning and collaboration between teams, align on goals, identify dependencies, mitigate risks, and effectively communicate regular updates to all stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate an understanding of the business and its structure, processes, and tools, and how initiatives positively impact the overall business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain best practices and repeatable processes to increase efficiency for teams in conjunction with the larger Technology Solutions group&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
