&lt;li&gt;Experience with Risk and Regulatory compliance frameworks such as&amp;nbsp; NIST CSF 2.0, NIST SP 800-53, ISO 27001/27002, SOC 2, PCI DSS, SOX ITGC, CCPA/CPRA, GDPR, EU Cyber Resilience Act (CRA), HIPAA, AI Governance, and Privacy by Design&lt;/li&gt;
