&lt;li&gt;Audit &amp;amp; Assurance experience including Internal Audit Coordination, External Audit Management, Evidence Collection, Control Testing, Remediation Tracking, Audit Readiness, and Continuous Monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor &amp;amp; Third-Party Security including Vendor Risk Assessments, Security Questionnaires, Contract Security Requirements, DPAs, Security Riders, Vendor Scorecards, and Continuous Vendor Monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be self-motivating, self-sufficient and have the strong ability to work effectively as an individual or as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accuracy, acute attention to detail, and ability to work with minimal direct supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideal candidate is inquisitive, organized, meticulous and has a desire for continued self-improvement and development of new skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to demonstrate a calm and cool demeanor when managing multiple projects and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding time management skills to balance multiple, changing priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with both agile and waterfall methodologies, and knowing when to apply each, preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with tools such as JIRA, Confluence, Smartsheet and Google Suite, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to haves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in or managing projects related to technology or streaming, a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certification such as PMP, CSM&lt;/li&gt;
