&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About Crunchyroll&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded by fans, Crunchyroll delivers the art and culture of anime to a passionate community. We super-serve over 100 million anime and manga fans across 200+ countries and territories, and help them connect with the stories and characters they crave. Whether that experience is online or in-person, streaming video, theatrical, games, merchandise, events and more, it’s powered by the anime content we all love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking two (2) Senior CX Program Managers who will serve as a strategic operational advisors. You will drive &lt;strong&gt;process excellence, operational transformation, and cross-functional execution &lt;/strong&gt;across the Customer Experience organization. You will partner with CX leaders to optimize operational efficiency, build scalable operating models, and ensure initiatives are executed through strong governance, structured program management, and continuous process improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role you will design, implement, and own the Customer Experience Process Change Framework—a standardized intake, evaluation, governance, implementation, and communication model for all operational changes. This framework will become the foundation for how CX evaluates, prioritizes, implements, and communicates operational change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Thought Partner &amp;amp; Trusted Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streamline processes and improve communication in order to enable leaders to focus on strategic initiatives and high level decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish standardized intake, prioritization, governance, implementation, and communication processes for all Customer Experience initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze, map, and document current-state and future-state workflows across Customer Experience, including customer-facing, agent-facing, and internal operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and optimize agent workflows, support processes, and operational procedures to improve efficiency, consistency, quality, and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify operational bottlenecks, inefficiencies, and opportunities to simplify, standardize, automate, and scale processes.&lt;/li&gt;
