&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Enterprise Security Engineer to help design, implement, and mature our enterprise security program across endpoints, SaaS, cloud, AI tooling, identity, and corporate infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on engineering role ideal for someone who enjoys solving complex access challenges while improving security, usability, and operational efficiency. This role will work closely with Security, IT, Engineering, Compliance, and business stakeholders to build secure-by-design solutions, drive automation, and reduce organizational risk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and improve enterprise security operations capabilities across endpoints, SaaS, cloud and corporate networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and tune detections, alerts, and automated response workflows within SIEM, SOAR and EDR platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain automation for operational security workflows and response processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering and IT teams to improve monitoring, logging, and incident response readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the SaaS security lifecycle by performing tool security reviews, enforcing robust controls, and maintaining continuous monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve security posture through developing hardening standards and configuration reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define and implement security controls for AI tools, workflows, and integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop governance and monitoring practices around data exposure, prompt injection, access control, and safe AI usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business teams to enable secure adoption of AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and enhance security controls across corporate networks and remote access solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Governance, Risk, and Compliance team to support vendor security reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with infrastructure teams to strengthen enterprise security architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to security standards, documentation, and operational playbooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
