&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EDGE Discovery team at Crunchyroll is focused on powering content discoverability experiences across the platform. We build and evolve the backend systems that enable anime fans worldwide to seamlessly discover, browse, search, and engage with Crunchyroll’s catalog through personalized, highly scalable experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our systems power critical user journeys, including home page personalization, search, recommendations, metadata delivery, content ranking, and discovery APIs across all Crunchyroll platforms and devices. We operate at the intersection of backend platform engineering, large-scale distributed systems, and machine-learning enablement, with a strong focus on performance, scalability, relevance, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Backend Senior Engineer, you will help drive the technical direction and architecture of the services that power Crunchyroll’s discovery ecosystem. You will partner closely with engineering, product, data, and machine learning teams to build highly scalable backend platforms that improve content discoverability and user engagement while enabling teams to iterate quickly and safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys solving complex challenges in distributed systems, scaling high-traffic backend services, and building systems that directly impact how millions of users discover and experience content. Experience building backend systems for large-scale streaming, media, or other consumer content platforms is strongly preferred for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Design, develop, and evolve scalable backend systems that power search, recommendations, personalization, and content discovery experiences across Crunchyroll platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Lead architectural decisions for distributed systems with a focus on scalability, low latency, resiliency, observability, and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Build and optimize APIs, metadata services, indexing pipelines, ranking systems, and recommendation infrastructure that support high-throughput user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Partner closely with product, machine learning, data, and platform teams to improve discovery relevance, personalization quality, and experimentation capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Drive backend platform improvements that enhance developer productivity, deployment safety, and service reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Define and implement engineering best practices around API design, data consistency, caching strategies, asynchronous processing, resiliency, and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Identify and proactively address performance bottlenecks, scaling challenges, and operational risks across discovery systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Support experimentation and A/B testing frameworks that enable rapid iteration on discovery and recommendation experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Mentor engineers and provide technical leadership through design reviews, architecture discussions, and cross-team collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Influence long-term technical direction and build alignment across multiple engineering organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Champion engineering excellence through pragmatic improvements to tooling, automation, documentation, and operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated engineer with deep backend engineering expertise and a strong track record of building scalable distributed systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful in this role, you should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 8+ years of experience designing and building large-scale backend systems and microservices architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong proficiency in backend development, distributed systems design, API architecture, and cloud-native technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience operating high-traffic services in production environments with strong understanding of scalability, fault tolerance, observability, and reliability engineering principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong experience with large-scale video streaming, media, or consumer content platforms, including an understanding of the performance, reliability, and scale requirements of streaming user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience with search systems, recommendation platforms, personalization systems, metadata services, or large-scale content delivery architectures, preferably in a streaming environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong understanding of caching strategies, asynchronous processing, event-driven architectures, and distributed data consistency patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience with AWS or similar cloud platforms, including modern infrastructure and deployment patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Familiarity with experimentation platforms, analytics pipelines, or machine learning integration workflows is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience improving engineering productivity through platform capabilities, automation, tooling, or developer experience initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Excellent problem-solving, communication, and technical leadership skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Proven ability to collaborate effectively across engineering, product, platform, and data organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ability to influence technical direction and drive alignment in highly cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong sense of ownership and empathy for both internal engineering teams and end-user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The EDGE Discovery team is responsible for the backend systems and platform capabilities that power content discovery across Crunchyroll. We enable personalized and scalable user experiences through search, recommendations, metadata services, ranking systems, and discovery APIs, helping fans connect with the content they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team focuses on building resilient, scalable, and high-performance backend services that support millions of users globally in a rapidly evolving content ecosystem. We value ownership, collaboration, experimentation, and continuous improvement while working closely with cross-functional partners to shape the future of content discovery at Crunchyroll.&lt;/p&gt;
