&lt;p&gt;Join our team, and help us shape the future of anime!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the SVOD Strategy Senior Manager at Crunchyroll, you will support the development of the long-term strategy for the SVOD line of business (LOB). This position will report directly to the Director of SVOD Strategy within the COO organization to translate Crunchyroll’s vision into a comprehensive set of initiatives and goals for the SVOD LOB. The team partners with key stakeholders, including Growth and Planning, Marketing, Product, and Business Development, to establish a common set of priorities for the SVOD LOB, while ensuring leadership is informed with the necessary insights to grow intentionally in a rapidly evolving market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Areas of Responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the SVOD operating rhythm, ensuring alignment between strategic goals, quarterly priorities, and financial performance reviews across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the ongoing evolution of Crunchyroll’s global membership vision and strategy, ensuring alignment with company goals and fan needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and evaluate big, long-term bets for Crunchyroll to consider over a 5-10 year horizon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and refine Crunchyroll’s anime total addressable market (TAM) and fan segmentation models to inform membership strategy and LOB planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor global and regional competitive trends to generate insights, learnings, and opportunities for the SVOD LOB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct underlying research and analysis to generate insights that inform the 5-year strategic plan for the SVOD LOB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain regionalization playbooks and territory factbases to ensure stakeholder teams are updated and aligned on regional investment strategies and performance trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct territory-specific deep dive evaluations to ensure local business model dynamics are aligned alignment with long-term objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct ongoing benchmarking, competitive analyses, and regional optimization assessments of the membership model, including benefit offerings and price/value alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead business cases for new or expanded membership benefits, including opportunity sizing, go/no-go recommendations, and test-and-learn design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute ad-hoc projects and initiatives in support of the Senior Management Team (SMT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;un1s9m&quot; data-start=&quot;384&quot; data-end=&quot;549&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience in management consulting, corporate strategy, or enterprise strategy within a technology, media, streaming, or consumer digital business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ghkkvt&quot; data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;690&quot;&gt;Exceptional analytical, problem-solving, and executive communication skills, with experience presenting recommendations to C-suite leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lcdtbx&quot; data-start=&quot;691&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence senior stakeholders and build trusted partnerships across cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;keoml&quot; data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity and adapting quickly as priorities and business needs evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3llg93&quot; data-start=&quot;1030&quot; data-end=&quot;1140&quot;&gt;Prior experience in digital subscription services, advertising, e-commerce, or consumer technology is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or equivalent advanced degree from a recognized institution is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
